abstract: >-
  A complete, bilingual (English and Brazilian Portuguese) guide to
  Agentic DevOps, AI Agents, and modern software development, explained
  through Super Mario World analogies so that anyone can understand —
  from Git and CI/CD to GitHub Copilot, RAG, MCP, and Kubernetes.
